WEBVTT

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:17.630
What do you want?

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:19.030
Well, I was told outside that...

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:22.500
Don't give me that, you snotty-faced heap of parrot droppings!

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:22.760
What?

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.960
Shut your festering gob, you tit!

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:29.960
Your type really makes me puke, you vacuous, coffee-nosed...

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.310
He came here for an argument, I'm not going to just...

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:35.970
Oh! Oh, I'm sorry, but this is abuse.

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:37.940
Oh, I see, well that explains...

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:40.240
Oh yes, you want room 12A just along the corridor.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.580
Oh, thank you very much, sorry.

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:42.800
Not at all. Thank you.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:44.000
Stupid kid.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:06.180
It's all so sad. At times like this, I just need someone to hold me.

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:09.520
Mmm, you like holding me, don't you?

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:12.980
Hey, you know what always cheers you up? Baking me a nice tray of sugar cookies.

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.140
How about these cookies, sugar?

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:32.810
Hello, I want to...

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:36.090
No, no, no, hold your head like this, then you go, wow, try it again.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:39.480
Better, better, but wow, wow, put your hand there.

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:39.740
No.

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:40.100
No.

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:40.600
Wow.

00:01:41.110 --> 00:01:41.870
Good, that's it.

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:42.510
Stop hitting me.

00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:42.690
What?

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:43.510
Stop hitting me.

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:44.090
Stop hitting you?

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:44.330
Yes.

00:01:44.550 --> 00:01:45.210
Why'd you come in here, then?

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:46.070
I wanted to complain.

00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:47.750
Oh, no, that's next door.

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:49.330
It's being hit on the head lessons in here.

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:50.350
What a stupid concept.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:13.040
Your son never told you what happened to your father.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:14.780
He told me enough.

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:19.170
Told me you killed him.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:19.780
No.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:27.680
No.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.220
It's not true!

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:35.060
That's impossible!

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:38.560
Search your feelings, you know it to be true!

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:59.320
Religion has actually convinced people!

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:08.110
That there's an invisible man living in the sky who watches everything you do every minute of every day.

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:13.770
And the invisible man has a special list of ten things he does not want you to do.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:22.070
And if you do any of these ten things, he has a special place full of fire and smoke and burning and torture and anguish

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:29.290
where he will send you to live and suffer and burn and choke and scream and cry forever and ever till the end of time.

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:31.870
But he loves you.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.550
Bailey Gates, want to see my weasel?

00:03:58.020 --> 00:03:59.960
Hey, hot dogs here, all you can eat, get your...

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:01.480
A footlong in a bag of nuts.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.610
Once there was an ugly barnacle.

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:08.190
He was so ugly that everyone died.

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:09.170
The end.

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:46.120
Back in the kitchen. Free boat ride for three.
